1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:01,830
(Raj:)it would give you an
open floor plan,

2
00:00:01,832 --> 00:00:06,002
(Raj:)and then-- it's a little scary,
but could be fun--

3
00:00:06,003 --> 00:00:09,003
(Raj:)indoor fire pit.

4
00:00:09,006 --> 00:00:10,706
(doorbell rings)

5
00:00:10,707 --> 00:00:12,777
(Howard:)Hey, I grew up
in this house, okay?

6
00:00:12,776 --> 00:00:15,676
(Howard:)No one's knocking anything down.

7
00:00:15,679 --> 00:00:17,179
(Bernadette:)Okay, okay.

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,610
(Bernadette:)When he's at Comic-Con,

9
00:00:18,615 --> 00:00:21,245
(Bernadette:)I'm bringing in
a wrecking ball.

10
00:00:23,686 --> 00:00:24,686
(Howard(answering door):)Can I help you?

11
00:00:24,688 --> 00:00:27,088
(Guy at door:)Hi. Are you Howard Wolowitz?

12
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:28,560
(Raj:)Yes.

13
00:00:28,558 --> 00:00:30,458
(Guy:)Um, this is a little weird,

14
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,690
(Guy:)but a lawyer was trying
to contact my father,

15
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,066
(Guy:)because his name was still
on the title for this house.

16
00:00:35,065 --> 00:00:37,735
W... uh, who's your father?

17
00:00:37,734 --> 00:00:39,564
(Guy:)Sam Wolowitz.

18
00:00:39,569 --> 00:00:40,939
(chuckles)

19
00:00:40,937 --> 00:00:43,537
S-Sam Wolowitz is my father.

20
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,470
(Guy:)I know.

21
00:00:45,475 --> 00:00:49,375
(Howard:)Well, wait, so if we have
the same father...

22
00:00:49,379 --> 00:00:50,409
I mean,

23
00:00:50,414 --> 00:00:51,644
(Howard:)are you saying

24
00:00:51,648 --> 00:00:52,748
(Howard:)you're my half-brother?

25
00:00:52,749 --> 00:00:54,549
(Guy:)I think so.

26
00:00:54,551 --> 00:00:55,651
(chuckles)

27
00:00:55,652 --> 00:01:01,022
(Howard:)Bernadette, weird things
are happening out here!

